<title>SWEDEN: Volvo appoints head of U.S. truck unit.</title>
<headline>Volvo appoints head of U.S. truck unit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo said on Friday it had appointed Marc Gustafson to head its truck operations in North America with immediate effect.</p>
<p>&quot;Marc Gustafson has been appointed president and chief executive officer of Volvo GM Heavy Truck Corporation,&quot; Volvo Truck said in a statement.</p>
<p>Gustafson has been president and CEO of Mack Trucks Inc., Canada, Volvo said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
